# Without the value, a refusal states the rule and the client still cannot see what it sent.

title: the refusal names the rule and drops the value that broke it
file: internal/ledgerhttp/accounts.go
run: go test -count=1 -run TestTheKindRefusalOnAnOpenCarriesTheKindAndTheKindsThereAre -v ./internal/ledgerhttp/
--- before
			Error:     "no such account kind",
			Parameter: "kind",
			Value:     shown(req.Kind),
			Valid:     validKinds(err),
--- after
			Error:     "no such account kind",
			Parameter: "kind",
			Valid:     validKinds(err),
